? ???? ?? ??????? ??\\n???? ????? ???\\n??? ???? ?? ???? ???\\n??? ?? ????? ???\",\"romanText\":\"Roop Bhajan hik roop aa,\\nAahe Brahm Saroop.\\nRoop Bhajan anoop aa,\\nAahe Jyoti Saroop.\\nShiv Bhajan ji Samadhi jo,\\nJeko dhyaan dhare.\\nShiv Bhajan sabh kaaraj kiya,\\nMehr jo hathro dhare.\",\"hindiText\":null,\"isCenteredBold\":false},{\"stanzaNumber\":24,\"sindhiText\":\"??? ?????? ?? ???? ????\\n????? ???? ?? ?? ?? ????\\n????? ???? ?? ?? ???\\n???? ???? ? ???? ???\\n?????? ??????? ??? ??? ??????\\n??????? ?????? ??? ???? ?? ?????\\n???? ?? ????? ???? ?? ???\\n??? ???? ? ???? ???\",\"romanText\":\"Daas Diwan jo maalik aaheen,\\nTokhaan siwa bee aas na kaai.\\nMaloom tokhe dil jo haal,\\nRoop Bhajan aa taaran haar.\\nKaruna tuhinji nis din chaahiyaan,\\nTuhinji karuna bin chain na paayaan.\\nMehr ja hathra moon te dhaar,\\nShiv Bhajan aa taaran haar.\",\"hindiText\":null,\"isCenteredBold\":false},{\"stanzaNumber\":25,\"sindhiText\":\"???? ??? ???? ?????? ???? ????\\n????? ?? ???? ???? ?????\\n??? ??? ????? ?????\\n???? ???? ? ???? ???\\n?????? ???? ?- ???- ????\\n??? ?? ?????? ??? ?- ????\\n??? ?? ??????? ??? ?????\\n??? ???? ? ???? ???\",\"romanText\":\"Prem saan jeko Amrit Vani gaaye,\\nTanhin ja kaaraj safal banaaye.\\nTaap paap shatru vinaash,\\nRoop Bhajan aa taaran haar.\\nAmrit Vani aa var dhaayak,\\nPaan hee likhaai paan aa vaachak.\\nPaan hee tanhinjo kare achaar,\\nShiv Bhajan aa taaran haar.\",\"hindiText\":null,\"isCenteredBold\":false},{\"stanzaNumber\":26,\"sindhiText\":\"???? ????? ?? ???? ???????\\n???? ?????? ???? ????\\n???????? ??? ? ??? ???? ???\\n???? ???? ? ???? ???\\n???? ???? ????? ???????\\n?? ????? ?? ??????? ??????\\n???? ???? ??? ???? ??????\\n??? ???? ? ???? ???\",\"romanText\":\"Saari Sangat jo arz aghaai,\\nJeko Amrit Vani gaaye.\\nTuhinji pal mein lah toon saar,\\nRoop Bhajan aa taaran haar.\\nAlap budhi aahiyan agyaani,\\nDe charnan raj panhinji Swami.\\nCharan kamal taan vanjaan balhaar,\\nShiv Bhajan aa taaran haar.\",\"hindi